      "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Hey Guys,</p>\n<p>The games that won the Dexterity game contest look very interesting!&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Are we going to see any of these games in the store or on a Kickstarter soon?&nbsp; I'll be honest, the two I am most interested in are the two runner ups, but I could easily be swayed to buy the other 2 as well.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I think it's really great that Dice Hate Me runs these contests.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; Gooday,</p>\n<p>&nbsp; Richie</p>",
